  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 0b. Load the perturbative machinery from the Experiments notebook, same way.\n       Cells taken (1-based, as in SU4_twisted_Baxter_L2.wb):\n         14  irreps (tensor-product decomposition)\n         39  Section 8 setup: psi, th, u0, zser\n         44-47  untwisted (order eps^0) closed forms: degU, tc0U, QsolveU  -- the leading order\n               is UNIQUE and RATIONAL, which is the whole point: no algebraic branches anywhere\n         68  JointSolve: all four branches, one shared tau, exponential ansatz, expanded\n             around the untwisted solution, orders 1..N solved together.\n       The last displayed expression of cell 46 refers to symbols defined elsewhere in that\n       notebook (tcExact0, sol0); it is only a printout, the definitions it makes are complete. ---- *)\nexpPath = \"/home/paul/git_projects/gaudin-CG/Paul/Mathematica/XXX/Experiments/SU4_twisted_Baxter_L2.wb\";\nexpCells = Import[expPath, \"RawJSON\"][\"cells\"];\nQuiet[ToExpression /@ (joinCont[expCells[[#]][\"value\"]] & /@ {14, 39, 44, 45, 46, 47, 68})];\n{\"loaded\", Head /@ {irreps, degU, tc0U, QsolveU, JointSolve, zser}}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961318\" data-output-id=\"102\" data-out-n=\"13\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"13\" data-sub-end=\"13\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[13]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FsaWduZWR9CiAgJlxsZWZ0XHtcdGV4dHtsb2FkZWR9LFxsZWZ0XHtcbWF0aHJte1N5bWJvbH0sXG1hdGhybXtTeW1ib2x9LFxtYXRocm17U3ltYm9sfSxcbWF0aHJte1N5bWJvbH0gXHJpZ2h0LiBccmlnaHQuIFxcCiAgJlxsZWZ0LiBcbGVmdC4gLFxtYXRocm17U3ltYm9sfSxcbWF0aHJte1N5bWJvbH1ccmlnaHRcfVxyaWdodFx9ClxlbmR7YWxpZ25lZH0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">loaded</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Symbol</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Symbol</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Symbol</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Symbol</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Symbol</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Symbol</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[13]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\text{loaded},\\left\\{\\mathrm{Symbol},\\mathrm{Symbol},\\mathrm{Symbol},\\mathrm{Symbol} \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\mathrm{Symbol},\\mathrm{Symbol}\\right\\}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
