   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. The unimodular ray.  z_j = Exp[I eps psi_j] with Sum_j psi_j = 0, so\n       z_1 z_2 z_3 z_4 = 1 EXACTLY and phi_j = I eps psi_j is linear in eps.\n       The Experiments notebook's psi = {1,1/3,1/5,1/7} is NOT unimodular and must not be used\n       with the scalar product (recorded trap); psi_4 is replaced by -(psi_1+psi_2+psi_3).\n       Everything below is a power series in eps: no algebraic branches ever appear, because the\n       leading (untwisted) problem is unique and rational. ---- *)\npsi = {1, 1/3, 1/5, -(1 + 1/3 + 1/5)};\nsubX = Join[th, Table[z[j] -> Exp[I eps psi[[j]]], {j, 4}]];   (* EXACT twist, for the residues *)\n{\"Sum psi\", Total[psi], \"unimodular exactly?\", Simplify[Times @@ (Exp[I eps psi[[#]]] & /@ Range[4])] === 1}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961318\" data-output-id=\"103\" data-out-n=\"16\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"8\" data-sub-end=\"8\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[16]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1x0ZXh0e1N1bSBwc2l9LDAsXHRleHR7dW5pbW9kdWxhciBleGFjdGx5P30sXG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfVxyaWdodFx9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Sum psi</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unimodular exactly?</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[16]= \\left\\{\\text{Sum psi},0,\\text{unimodular exactly?},\\mathrm{True}\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "370d1e0a-a004-4a4f-81f3-605511e82ea3"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 2. From a JointSolve result to a solution record of the shape the scalar product wants.\n       JointSolve normalises p_k(0) = 1 (NOT monic): that is what keeps every branch finite as\n       eps -> 0, at the price that all four branches collapse onto the same untwisted P_1 at\n       leading order. An overall constant per branch only rescales rows/columns of M^{AB}, so it\n       cannot affect whether a determinant vanishes.\n       Orders: with a solve to order N, everything up to order N-2 is determined; the still-free\n       top-order coefficients are set to zero and the series truncated at Ntr <= N-2. ---- *)\nClearAll[recOf, trunc];\ntrunc[Ntr_][e_] := Normal[Series[e, {eps, 0, Ntr}]];\nrecOf[jr_, SS_, PP_, mu_, N_, Ntr_] := Module[{Mk = Mdeg[SS, PP, mu], s = First[jr[\"sol\"]], q0 = jr[\"q0\"], zero, co},\n   zero = Thread[jr[\"free\"] -> 0];\n   co[k_, j_] := trunc[Ntr][((If[j <= Length[q0] - 1, q0[[j + 1]], 0] + Sum[eps^n pcn[k, j, n], {n, N}]) /. s) /. zero];\n   <|\"M\" -> Mk,\n     \"tc\" -> Table[trunc[Ntr][(((tc0U[mu, SS, PP] /. th)[[i]] + Sum[eps^n tcn[i, n], {n, N}]) /. s) /. zero], {i, 5}],\n     \"q\" -> Table[Prepend[Table[co[k, j], {j, Mk[[k]]}], 1], {k, 4}]|>];\n\nrecV = recOf[jV5, 1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 5, 3];\nColumn[recV[\"q\"]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961318\" data-output-id=\"104\" data-out-n=\"21\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[21]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.56em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.36em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.07em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">69568625</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2144</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">eps</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.07em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"si