  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. eps-order bookkeeping, and the two states used below.\n       (A weight of multiplicity > 1 has a second state that is a DESCENDANT untwisted, which\n       QsolveU does not produce; the same-weight sharp test therefore needs separate work.)\n\n       TWO TRAPS, both hit here:\n       (i) the series coefficients are exact but not in normal form, and PossibleZeroQ silently\n           misses the zeros -- so every coefficient is Simplify'd before the zero test;\n       (ii) FirstPosition searches HEADS too, and returns {0} (the List head) for any pattern the\n           list itself matches. LengthWhile avoids the whole question.\n       A third: an entry order equal to the truncation order is truncation noise, not a result --\n       cell 4 solves to eps^7 and truncates at eps^5 for exactly this reason. ---- *)\nClearAll[ordL, coefList];\ncoefList[e_, K_] := Simplify[Table[SeriesCoefficient[e, {eps, 0, n}], {n, 0, K}]];\nordL[e_, K_] := Module[{c = coefList[e, K], m}, m = LengthWhile[c, # === 0 &]; If[m == Length[c], Infinity, m]];\n\"3. order bookkeeping loaded\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"961318\" data-output-id=\"112\" data-out-n=\"65\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"5\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[65]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7My4gb3JkZXIgYm9va2tlZXBpbmcgbG9hZGVkfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3. order bookkeeping loaded</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[65]= \\text{3. order bookkeeping loaded}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "ec3a7fa6-3173-4c0e-af8b-787a0a7a3b8f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Does orthogonality survive the twist expansion?  TWO PAIRS ONLY:\n       the norm V|V and the cross V|A, with V = irrep {2,2,0,0}, A = irrep {2,1,1,0} at (S,P)=(1,1).\n       Solved to order eps^7, truncated at eps^5, so entries are trustworthy through order eps^5\n       and the order-4 block below is genuine, not truncation noise.\n\n       Structure from cell 3:  rows alpha=1 : beta=0 vanishes identically, beta=1 is O(eps^4)\n                               rows alpha=2 : every entry O(eps^2)\n       so M^{AB} = [[0, X],[Y, Z]], X = (alpha=1,beta=1), Y = (alpha=2,beta=0), and\n       det M = +- det X det Y exactly. ---- *)\nClearAll[lead, blocks];\nlead[e_, K_] := Module[{o = ordL[e, K]}, If[o === Infinity, 0, Simplify[SeriesCoefficient[e, {eps, 0, o}]]]];\nblocks[MA_, K_] := Module[{X = MA[[1 ;; 4, {2, 4, 6, 8}]], Y = MA[[5 ;; 8, {1, 3, 5, 7}]], Z = MA[[1 ;; 4, {1, 3, 5, 7}]], Xl, Yl},\n   Xl = Map[lead[#, K] &, X, {2}]; Yl = Map[lead[#, K] &, Y, {2}];\n   <|\"zeroBlk\" -> Union[Flatten[Map[ordL[#, K] &, Z, {2}]]],\n     \"ordX\" -> Union[Flatten[Map[ordL[#, K] &, X, {2}]]], \"ordY\" -> Union[Flatten[Map[ordL[#, K] &, Y, {2}]]],\n     \"rankX\" -> MatrixRank[Xl], \"rankY\" -> MatrixRank[Yl],\n     \"detX\" -> Simplify[Det[Xl]], \"detY\" -> Simplify[Det[Yl]]|>];\n\nrecV7 = recOf[jV7, 1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, 7, 5];\nrecA7 = recOf[jA7, 1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, 7, 5];\nMVV7 = spMatFSoV[1, 1, recV7, recV7, subX];\nMVA7 = spMatFSoV[1, 1, recV7, recA7, subX];\nbVV = blocks[MVV7, 5]; bVA = blocks[MVA7, 5];\n\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{p[[1]], p[[2]], p[[3]][\"zeroBlk\"], p[[3]][\"ordX\"], p[[3]][\"ordY\"], p[[3]][\"rankX\"], p[[3]][\"rankY\"],\n    p[[3]][\"detX\"] === 0, p[[3]][\"detY\"] === 0}, {p, {{\"V|V\", \"norm\", bVV}, {\"V|A\", \"cross\", bVA}}}],\n  {\"A|B\", \"kind\", \"ord (a=1,b=0)\", \"ord X\", \"ord Y\", \"rank X_lead\", \"rank Y_lead\", \"det X_lead = 0\", \"det Y_lead = 0\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
