 class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[66]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{row (al,i,j) \\\\ (r,beta)} & 1\\text{,}0 & 1\\text{,}1 & 21\\text{,}0 & 21\\text{,}1 & 22\\text{,}0 & 22\\text{,}1 & 3\\text{,}0 & 3\\text{,}1\\\\\\hline\\text{(}1\\text{,}1\\text{,}3\\text{)} & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4\\\\\\hline\\text{(}1\\text{,}1\\text{,}4\\text{)} & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4\\\\\\hline\\text{(}1\\text{,}2\\text{,}3\\text{)} & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4\\\\\\hline\\text{(}1\\text{,}2\\text{,}4\\text{)} & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4 & 5 & 4\\\\\\hline\\text{(}2\\text{,}1\\text{,}3\\text{)} & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2\\\\\\hline\\text{(}2\\text{,}1\\text{,}4\\text{)} & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2\\\\\\hline\\text{(}2\\text{,}2\\text{,}3\\text{)} & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2\\\\\\hline\\text{(}2\\text{,}2\\text{,}4\\text{)} & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
