   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. ROUTE 2. Deform the FOUR DISTINCT untwisted solutions P_1..P_4 (staggered degrees\n       Mhat = degU = {0,1,4,5} for V), rather than pushing all four branches off P_1 the way\n       JointSolve does.\n\n       Two facts, both established here:\n       (i) with a FIXED degree Mhat_k per branch the system is INCONSISTENT -- branch 4 already\n           fails at order eps^1 (12 equations, 11 unknowns), branches 1-3 are fine;\n       (ii) it becomes consistent as soon as the degree grows by one per order,\n            deg p_k^(n) = Mhat_k + n. That growth IS the rotation: the solution tending to P_k is\n            a combination of branches with 1/eps coefficients, and expanding Exp[(phi_j-phi_k)u]\n            raises the degree by one per order.\n\n       SPEED: the graded system is QUADRATIC across orders (tcn[i,1] pcn[k,j,1] enters at order 2),\n       so a single Solve over all orders is nonlinear, slow, and returns spurious branches. Solved\n       order by order it is LINEAR at each step, the lower orders being already-known numbers:\n       minutes -> seconds.\n       TRAP: Thread[{} == 0] is an Equal, not a list, and poisons the Join -- map the == instead. *)\nClearAll[BranchSolve3];\nBranchSolve3[SS_, PP_, mu_, Nord_, x_] := Module[{dk, P, tcser, pf, R, acc = {}, fr = {}, eqs, unk, gauge, sol},\n   dk = degU[mu, SS, PP]; P = QsolveU[mu, SS, PP] /. th;\n   tcser = Table[tc[i] -> (tc0U[mu, SS, PP] /. th)[[i]] + Sum[eps^n tcn[i, n], {n, Nord}], {i, 5}];\n   pf[k_] := Function[y, Evaluate[qpoly[P[[k]], y] + Sum[eps^n Sum[pcn[k, j, n] y^j, {j, 0, dk[[k]] + n}], {n, Nord}]]];\n   R = Table[Expand[((BaxRes[SS, PP, mu][k][pf[k]][x] /. th) /. zser[Nord]) /. tcser], {k, 4}];\n   Do[eqs = DeleteCases[Expand[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Coefficient[R[[k]], eps, n], x], {k, 4}]] /. acc], 0];\n      unk = Join[Table[tcn[i, n], {i, 5}], Flatten[Table[pcn[k, j, n], {k, 4}, {j, 0, dk[[k]] + n}]]];\n      gauge = Flatten[Table[pcn[k, dk[[jj]], n], {k, 4}, {jj, k}]];\n      sol = Quiet@Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ Join[eqs, gauge], unk];\n      If[sol === {}, Return[<|\"order\" -> n, \"status\" -> \"inconsistent\"|>]];\n      acc = Join[acc, First[sol]]; fr = Join[fr, Complement[unk, First[sol][[All, 1]]]], {n, Nord}];\n   <|\"deg\" -> dk, \"P\" -> P, \"sol\" -> {acc}, \"free\" -> fr|>];\n\nGrid[Prepend[Table[With[{r = BranchSolve3[1, 1, {2, 2, 0, 0}, Nn, uu]}, {Nn, r[\"deg\"], Length[First[r[\"sol\"]]], r[\"free\"]}], {Nn, 1, 3}],\n  {\"order N\", \"Mhat\", \"#determined\", \"still free (branch mixing)\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
