   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. ROUTE 2, where it stops. Order-by-order trace of the branchwise deformation:\n       gaugeQ toggles the gauge conditions, grow sets the degree growth deg p_k^(n) = Mhat_k + grow*n.\n       Result: consistent at eps^1 and eps^2, INCONSISTENT at eps^3, and faster degree growth is\n       worse, not better. The mixing coefficients are Laurent, not Taylor:\n       Q_2 + (a/eps) Q_1 = Exp[phi_2 u](q_2 + (a/eps) Exp[(phi_1-phi_2)u] q_1), whose degree after\n       normalising the leading order to eps^0 grows as deg q_1 + n + 1 -- an offset the ansatz\n       Mhat_k + n does not have. Re-solving the Baxter equation in this ansatz is the wrong way\n       round; the rotated basis should instead be BUILT from the Route-1 solutions, which are\n       already known to eps^7 (Baxter is linear, so (Q_2 - Q_1)/eps is again a solution and is\n       finite with leading term of degree 1). ---- *)\nClearAll[trace3];\ntrace3[gaugeQ_, grow_, Nord_] := Module[{SS = 1, PP = 1, mu = {2, 2, 0, 0}, x = uu, dk, P, tcser, pf, R, acc = {}, eqs, unk, gauge, sol, rep = {}},\n dk = degU[mu, SS, PP]; P = QsolveU[mu, SS, PP] /. th;\n tcser = Table[tc[i] -> (tc0U[mu, SS, PP] /. th)[[i]] + Sum[eps^n tcn[i, n], {n, Nord}], {i, 5}];\n pf[k_] := Function[y, Evaluate[qpoly[P[[k]], y] + Sum[eps^n Sum[pcn[k, j, n] y^j, {j, 0, dk[[k]] + grow n}], {n, Nord}]]];\n R = Table[Expand[((BaxRes[SS, PP, mu][k][pf[k]][x] /. th) /. zser[Nord]) /. tcser], {k, 4}];\n Do[eqs = DeleteCases[Expand[Flatten[Table[CoefficientList[Coefficient[R[[k]], eps, n], x], {k, 4}]] /. acc], 0];\n  unk = Join[Table[tcn[i, n], {i, 5}], Flatten[Table[pcn[k, j, n], {k, 4}, {j, 0, dk[[k]] + grow n}]]];\n  gauge = If[gaugeQ, Flatten[Table[pcn[k, dk[[jj]], n], {k, 4}, {jj, k}]], {}];\n  sol = Quiet@Solve[(# == 0 &) /@ Join[eqs, gauge], unk];\n  rep = Append[rep, {n, Length[eqs], Length[unk], If[sol === {}, \"INCONSISTENT\", \"ok\"]}];\n  If[sol === {}, Break[]]; acc = Join[acc, First[sol]], {n, Nord}]; rep];\n\nGrid[Prepend[Flatten[Table[Prepend[#, Row[{\"gauge=\", g, \", grow=\", gr}]] & /@ trace3[g, gr, 3], {g, {True, False}}, {gr, {1, 2}}], 2],\n  {\"variant\", \"order n\", \"#eqs\", \"#unk\", \"status\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
